{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a sealed domain was crafted for warriors to battle endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of a way to prolong your master's life, you venture into this unknown realm. But to leave, you must face those who came before you.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Boss Duels</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a series of unique opponents in intense fast-paced duels. Each boss brings their own distinct abilities and attacks for you to overcome.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/3df8d064117fa0f908a164a8eb2c19ab.poster.avif?t=1759936535\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/3df8d064117fa0f908a164a8eb2c19ab.webm?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/3df8d064117fa0f908a164a8eb2c19ab.mp4?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Master Your Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deflect, dodge, or even use your own attacks to parry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are available right from the start\u00a0\u2014 your success depends only on how you use them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/8cc96ebef862c9ee262b0bb4a28c61d2.poster.avif?t=1759936535\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/8cc96ebef862c9ee262b0bb4a28c61d2.webm?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/8cc96ebef862c9ee262b0bb4a28c61d2.mp4?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover Hidden Truths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every boss has a story. Learn as much\u00a0\u2014 or as little\u00a0\u2014 as you choose.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/c5f90f5ab9c7fc7ceeecffa57d987af1.poster.avif?t=1759936535\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/c5f90f5ab9c7fc7ceeecffa57d987af1.webm?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/c5f90f5ab9c7fc7ceeecffa57d987af1.mp4?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make Allies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a realm where death can be endlessly deferred, some defeated foes may return in unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/639cbcc141710191d400ceafab444c4e.poster.avif?t=1759936535\" width=1170 height=518 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/639cbcc141710191d400ceafab444c4e.webm?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/extras/639cbcc141710191d400ceafab444c4e.mp4?t=1759936535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear storyline with fast-paced action combat duels against multiple bosses.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly blend offense and defense with dodges, parries, and counter-attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All abilities are available from the start for you to play with.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional character stories and interactions enrich the world without interrupting gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692670?t=1759936535","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/9f4397ff6194290179ebbe3f58a27dfdc2cbef67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759936535","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/23a9f139592fd7196e40a55c80b1c2ce16dc9941/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759936535","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692670/23a9f139592fd7196e40a55c80b1c2ce16dc9941/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759936535","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game contains animated violence and revealing outfits. Some suggestive themes, but no explicit sexual content is present."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, a sealed domain was crafted for warriors to battle endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I